OL,3,AFreud confirms Beatles' songs to star
OL,4,Ain musical
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm producer Emma Freud has confirmed
OL,7,FThe Beatles have agreed for their songs
OL,8,Fto feature in a stage version of the
OL,9,Fmovie, Yesterday.
OL,11,FFreud is working on the show with her
OL,12,Fhusband, Richard Curtis. They were
OL,13,Fbehind the 2019 film and other box
OL,14,Foffice hits, including Love Actually
OL,15,Fand Bridget Jones's Diary.
OL,17,FShe called it "a huge deal", saying:
OL,18,F"They've [The Beatles] never done that
OL,19,Fwith a West End musical before. So it's
OL,20,Fthe first time that you can kind of
OL,21,Flegally see The Beatles' music on
OL,22,Fstage, which is amazing."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
