OL,3,AFreud confirms Beatles' songs to star
OL,4,Ain musical
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreud spoke to BBC Radio Suffolk on
OL,7,FMonday, after she received an honorary
OL,8,Fdoctorate for her work in film and
OL,9,Fbroadcasting at the University of
OL,10,FSuffolk on Saturday.
